This is an unofficial tree. It follows the conventions of, and contains files
adapted from, the following official LineageOS device trees (branch
lineage-24.0), all licensed under the Apache License 2.0 by The LineageOS
Project:

  - android_device_samsung_gts7l          (Samsung Qualcomm tablet: device layout,
    product makefiles, settings overlay)
  - android_device_samsung_sm8250-common  (SEPolicy conventions)
  - android_device_samsung_exynos9820-common  (renamed stock library fix-ups)
  - android_device_samsung_a73xq          (optical UDFPS fingerprint property)

The settings overlay carries an Android Open Source Project header.

The init script, the S Pen input configuration, the VINTF entries and the audio
effects configuration are taken from the stock Samsung SM-T865 firmware
(T865XXU6DXE1 vendor, T865XXU6DXJ1 system) and remain the property of their
respective owners (Samsung, Qualcomm / The Linux Foundation, as stated in
their headers).

Written for this port by lunar-seal, with the assistance of an AI model (see the
commit trailers): audio/amplifier, audio/speakereq, the touchscreen input
configuration, the thermal configuration and the SEPolicy. They are not the
work of The LineageOS Project. The filter parameters of audio/speakereq are
Samsung's, from the stock firmware.
